   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• A DM with the bot never becomes a room.   • The bot cannot create groups: you make the group, Switch adopts it.\n• Turning on Topics converts the group to a supergroup with a NEW chat id. Switch re-points the room;\n  our scripts follow migrate_to_chat_id.   • Agents never become Telegram users: \"@name\" is plain text.",
   "originalText": "• A DM with the bot never becomes a room.   • The bot cannot create groups: you make the group, Switch adopts it.\n• Turning on Topics converts the group to a supergroup with a NEW chat id. Switch re-points the room;\n  our scripts follow migrate_to_chat_id.   • Agents never become Telegram users: \"@name\" is plain text.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "re53",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
